  going up, which would move the break-even column in Monarch's favour.

  WHAT WOULD END THIS: MFU flat across m1, and the gap flat too. Then the
  head is memory bound on the clone, not compute bound on K, and no choice
  of factorisation fixes it. The fix would be a fused grouped GEMM that
